%% description: "How does checkout work?" answered from the existing diagram, with the path lit, not with prose.
sequenceDiagram
    actor developer as Developer
    participant coding_agent as Coding Agent
    participant archer as Archer
    participant web_page as Archer Page
    developer->>coding_agent: How does checkout work?
    coding_agent->>archer: list_diagrams
    archer-->>coding_agent: Views, notes, walkthroughs
    coding_agent->>archer: read_diagram checkout
    archer-->>coding_agent: Model with node and edge ids
    alt a walkthrough covers the question
        coding_agent->>archer: present_diagram with walkthrough
    else no walkthrough fits
        coding_agent->>archer: present_diagram with emphasis
    end
    archer->>web_page: The diagram, the path lit
    archer-->>coding_agent: Page URL
    coding_agent-->>developer: The URL and a few sentences
    developer->>web_page: Follow the path, ask about a part
    Note over coding_agent,archer: No new diagram, no change to its source
